#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:3
msgid "Server Requirements"
msgstr "서버 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:11
msgid "PHP and Required Extensions"
msgstr "PHP 및 필수 확장 기능"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:13
msgid ""
"`PHP <https://www.php.net/>`_ version 8.2 or newer is required, with the "
"following PHP extensions are enabled:"
msgstr "`PHP <https://www.php.net/>`_ 8.2 버전 이상이 필요하며, 다음 PHP 확장 기능이 활성화되어 있어야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:15
msgid "`intl <https://www.php.net/manual/en/intl.requirements.php>`_"
msgstr "`intl <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/intl.requirements.php>`_"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:16
msgid "`mbstring <https://www.php.net/manual/en/mbstring.installation.php>`_"
msgstr "`mbstring <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/mbstring.installation.php>`_"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:19
msgid "The end of life date for PHP 7.4 was November 28, 2022."
msgstr "PHP 7.4의 지원 종료(EOL) 날짜는 2022년 11월 28일이었습니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:20
msgid "The end of life date for PHP 8.0 was November 26, 2023."
msgstr "PHP 8.0의 지원 종료(EOL) 날짜는 2023년 11월 26일이었습니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:21
msgid "The end of life date for PHP 8.1 was December 31, 2025."
msgstr "PHP 8.1의 지원 종료(EOL) 날짜는 2025년 12월 31일이었습니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:22
msgid ""
"**If you are still using a PHP version below 8.2, you should upgrade "
"immediately.**"
msgstr "**\ 여전히 8.2 미만의 PHP 버전을 사용 중이라면 즉시 업그레이드해야 합니다.**"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:23
msgid "The end of life date for PHP 8.2 will be December 31, 2026."
msgstr "PHP 8.2의 지원 종료(EOL) 날짜는 2026년 12월 31일이 될 것입니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:26
msgid "PHP 8.5 requires CodeIgniter 4.7.0 or later."
msgstr "PHP 8.5는 CodeIgniter 4.7.0 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:27
msgid "PHP 8.4 requires CodeIgniter 4.6.0 or later."
msgstr "PHP 8.4는 CodeIgniter 4.6.0 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:28
msgid "PHP 8.3 requires CodeIgniter 4.4.4 or later."
msgstr "PHP 8.3는 CodeIgniter 4.4.4 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:29
msgid "PHP 8.2 requires CodeIgniter 4.2.11 or later."
msgstr "PHP 8.2는 CodeIgniter 4.2.11 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:30
msgid "PHP 8.1 requires CodeIgniter 4.1.6 or later."
msgstr "PHP 8.1는 CodeIgniter 4.1.6 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:31
msgid "**Note that we only maintain the latest version.**"
msgstr "**\ 최신 버전만 유지 관리된다는 점에 유의하세요.**"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:35
msgid "Optional PHP Extensions"
msgstr "선택적 PHP 확장 기능"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:37
msgid "The following PHP extensions should be enabled on your server:"
msgstr "서버에서 다음 PHP 확장 기능이 활성화되어 있어야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:39
msgid ""
"`mysqlnd <https://www.php.net/manual/en/mysqlnd.install.php>`_ (if you "
"use MySQL)"
msgstr "`mysqlnd <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/mysqlnd.install.php>`_ (MySQL을 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:40
msgid ""
"`curl <https://www.php.net/manual/en/curl.requirements.php>`_ (if you use"
" :doc:`CURLRequest </libraries/curlrequest>`)"
msgstr "`curl <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/curl.requirements.php>`_ (:doc:`CURLRequest </libraries/curlrequest>`\ 를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:41
msgid ""
"`imagick <https://www.php.net/manual/en/imagick.requirements.php>`_ (if "
"you use :doc:`Image </libraries/images>` class ImageMagickHandler)"
msgstr "`imagick <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/imagick.requirements.php>`_ (:doc:`Image </libraries/images>` 클래스의 ImageMagickHandler를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:42
msgid ""
"`gd <https://www.php.net/manual/en/image.requirements.php>`_ (if you use "
":doc:`Image </libraries/images>` class GDHandler)"
msgstr "`gd <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/image.requirements.php>`_ (:doc:`Image </libraries/images>` 클래스의 GDHandler를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:43
msgid ""
"`simplexml <https://www.php.net/manual/en/simplexml.requirements.php>`_ "
"(if you format XML)"
msgstr "`simplexml <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/simplexml.requirements.php>`_ (XML 형식을 지정하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:45
msgid "The following PHP extensions are required when you use a Cache server:"
msgstr "캐시 서버를 사용할 때 다음 PHP 확장 기능이 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:47
msgid ""
"`memcache <https://www.php.net/manual/en/memcache.requirements.php>`_ (if"
" you use :doc:`Cache </libraries/caching>` class MemcachedHandler with "
"Memcache)"
msgstr "`memcache <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/memcache.requirements.php>`_ (Memcache와 함께 :doc:`Cache </libraries/caching>` 클래스의 MemcachedHandler를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:48
msgid ""
"`memcached <https://www.php.net/manual/en/memcached.requirements.php>`_ "
"(if you use :doc:`Cache </libraries/caching>` class MemcachedHandler with"
" Memcached)"
msgstr "`memcached <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/memcached.requirements.php>`_ (Memcached와 함께 :doc:`Cache </libraries/caching>` 클래스의 MemcachedHandler를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:49
msgid ""
"`redis <https://github.com/phpredis/phpredis>`_ (if you use :doc:`Cache "
"</libraries/caching>` class RedisHandler)"
msgstr "`redis <https://github.com/phpredis/phpredis>`_ (:doc:`Cache </libraries/caching>` 클래스의 RedisHandler를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:51
msgid "The following PHP extensions are required when you use PHPUnit:"
msgstr "PHPUnit을 사용할 때 다음 PHP 확장 기능이 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:53
msgid ""
"`dom <https://www.php.net/manual/en/dom.requirements.php>`_ (if you use "
":doc:`TestResponse </testing/response>` class)"
msgstr "`dom <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/dom.requirements.php>`_ (:doc:`TestResponse </testing/response>` 클래스를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:54
msgid ""
"`libxml <https://www.php.net/manual/en/libxml.requirements.php>`_ (if you"
" use :doc:`TestResponse </testing/response>` class)"
msgstr "`libxml <https://www.php.net/manual/ko/libxml.requirements.php>`_ (:doc:`TestResponse </testing/response>` 클래스를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:55
msgid ""
"`xdebug <https://xdebug.org/docs/install>`_ (if you use "
"``CIUnitTestCase::assertHeaderEmitted()``)"
msgstr "`xdebug <https://xdebug.org/docs/install>`_ (``CIUnitTestCase::assertHeaderEmitted()``\ 를 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:61
msgid "Supported Databases"
msgstr "지원되는 데이터베이스"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:63
msgid ""
"A database is required for most web application programming. Currently "
"supported databases are:"
msgstr "대부분의 웹 애플리케이션 프로그래밍에는 데이터베이스가 필요합니다. 현재 지원되는 데이터베이스는 다음과 같습니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:66
msgid "MySQL via the ``MySQLi`` driver (version 5.1 and above only)"
msgstr "``MySQLi`` 드라이버를 통한 MySQL (5.1 버전 이상만 해당)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:67
msgid "PostgreSQL via the ``Postgre`` driver (version 7.4 and above only)"
msgstr "``Postgre`` 드라이버를 통한 PostgreSQL (7.4 버전 이상만 해당)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:68
msgid "SQLite3 via the ``SQLite3`` driver"
msgstr "``SQLite3`` 드라이버를 통한 SQLite3"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:69
msgid ""
"Microsoft SQL Server via the ``SQLSRV`` driver (version 2012 and above "
"only)"
msgstr "``SQLSRV`` 드라이버를 통한 Microsoft SQL Server (2012 버전 이상만 해당)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:70
msgid "Oracle Database via the ``OCI8`` driver (version 12.1 and above only)"
msgstr "``OCI8`` 드라이버를 통한 Oracle Database (12.1 버전 이상만 해당)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:72
msgid ""
"Not all of the drivers have been converted/rewritten for CodeIgniter4. "
"The list below shows the outstanding ones."
msgstr "모든 드라이버가 CodeIgniter4용으로 변환되거나 다시 작성된 것은 아닙니다. 아래 목록은 진행 중인 드라이버들을 보여줍니다."

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:75
msgid "MySQL (5.1+) via the *pdo* driver"
msgstr "*pdo* 드라이버를 통한 MySQL (5.1+)"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:76
msgid "Oracle via the *pdo* drivers"
msgstr "*pdo* 드라이버를 통한 Oracle"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:77
msgid "PostgreSQL via the *pdo* driver"
msgstr "*pdo* 드라이버를 통한 PostgreSQL"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:78
msgid "MSSQL via the *pdo* driver"
msgstr "*pdo* 드라이버를 통한 MSSQL"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:79
msgid "SQLite via the *sqlite* (version 2) and *pdo* drivers"
msgstr "*sqlite* (버전 2) 및 *pdo* 드라이버를 통한 SQLite"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:80
msgid "CUBRID via the *cubrid* and *pdo* drivers"
msgstr "*cubrid* 및 *pdo* 드라이버를 통한 CUBRID"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:81
msgid "Interbase/Firebird via the *ibase* and *pdo* drivers"
msgstr "*ibase* 및 *pdo* 드라이버를 통한 Interbase/Firebird"

#: ../../source/intro/requirements.rst:82
msgid ""
"ODBC via the *odbc* and *pdo* drivers (you should know that ODBC is "
"actually an abstraction layer)"
msgstr "*odbc* 및 *pdo* 드라이버를 통한 ODBC (ODBC가 실제로는 추상화 계층이라는 점을 알아두어야 합니다)"
